### Logowanie anna
POST http://localhost:3002/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"anna.nowak@example.com","password":"anna-password-123"}

### Logowanie piotr
POST http://localhost:3002/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"piotr.zielinski@example.com","password":"piotr-password-123"}

### Logowanie admin
POST http://localhost:3002/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@example.com","password":"admin-password-123"}

### Utworzenie rezerwacji (anna)
POST http://localhost:3002/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJyb2xlIjoiVVNFUiIsImlhdCI6MTc5NTIwOTE5MywiZXhwIjoxNzk1MjEwMDkzLCJzdWIiOiIyIn0.W-bUd1K0G-7sxEWOFx0NOKKLURDYuX9g8qekMHArgPw
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":1,"participants":10,"startTime":"2026-12-15T10:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-12-15T12:00:00Z"}

